OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government does not want new
OL,4,Anorthern national park, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new national park in north
OL,7,FWales are likely to be shelved after a
OL,8,Fgovernment minister told the Senedd he
OL,9,Fdid not want to set it up.
OL,11,FConstitutional Minister Dafydd Trystan
OL,12,FDavies said the Welsh government could
OL,13,Fachieve its environmental objectives
OL,14,Fwithout the cost of establishing the
OL,15,Fproposed Glyndwr National Park.
OL,17,FBut he said he wanted to hear views of
OL,18,Fothers over a four-week period before
OL,19,Fmaking a final decision, and noted the
OL,20,Fplan had been opposed by all councils
OL,21,Fin the areas the park would stretch
OL,22,Facross.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
