OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government does not want new
OL,4,Anorthern national park, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf created the national park would
OL,7,Fcover the Clwydian Range and Dee Valley
OL,8,Fand would be the first new national
OL,9,Fpark in Wales since 1957.
